WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.300
What's up guys!

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.960
We are Pongfinity

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:05.300
Today we are playing a game to 21 points with these different items.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.520
With each point you win,
you move on to the next item.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.400
First point is with a normal racket.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.220
Good luck!

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.180
Thanks.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:14.940
I will serve.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.040
0-0

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.640
Sorry!

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.040
Oh yeah! Now I get to defence.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.740
I'm stuck with my own racket!

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.020
Okay, penhold.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:00:59.840
Easy!

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.280
You started to move me around!

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.060
Of course

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.040
It's too heavy.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.860
And lucky again.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.020
No surprise there

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:36.780
Badminton!

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:37.880
This is my point.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:39.620
I think so too!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.600
That was so bad!

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.320
I'm starting to feel bad about my lucky
balls.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:10.560
Otto, I'm so sorry!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.540
You are always going for the edge.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.140
As soon as you hit it I saw the ball just coming

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:19.240
Coming straight to the edge!

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.140
Okay, dumbbell.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:20.900
[Miikka forgot the shoe..]

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:29.200
Smash with the dumbbell!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.200
I hate this ruler!

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:09.960
Close!

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.700
How did you play with this?

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.600
I'm tempted to eat this one

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.440
I had no chance to get that on!

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.020
No more chair for me!

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.120
This is my number 1 serve.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.680
Finally I got something in with this fork

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.640
No! It was close.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.600
The same spot.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:29.520
This is the match we have been waiting for.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.560
Pen vs pen.

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:32.860
Good feeling in the pen!

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:33.960
No 2-point difference.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.900
Okay so service on the table!

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:41.280
Easy!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.180
Thanks!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:43.840
Nice try.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.320
Okay so that was fun!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.700
Then pen was maybe a bit too difficult

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:49.280
Yeah it was really hard

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:50.900
Don't forget to hit subscribe

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:52.460
And watch our previous video there!

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:53.440
Until next time!

